B.avB=new A.pq("Study log","Each finished puzzle stores its result and the time it stayed on screen in the foreground. The lesson visit also stores when it started and when it ended. When you leave a lesson, that run is kept on this device. A release build sends the runs it has not sent yet on the first open of a new day, or when you tap Send study log now in Settings. A random id on this device groups those days together. The log has no name, and it is untraceable to you.",null)
B.avC=new A.pq("Problem reports","On a release build, each puzzle has a Report a problem link. If you send one, the app includes the lesson, the puzzle line in that lesson's course file, the course file name, and the note you write (up to 300 characters). It uses the same anonymous id as the study log. Nothing is sent unless you tap Send. The developer is emailed a copy of each report you send.",null)
B.avD=new A.pq("Favorites and character scores","Starring a puzzle, or removing that star, is sent on a release build with the lesson, the character or scene title, and the course file when there is one. Stars already saved on this device are included the first time this log is sent. A wrong answer on a single character adds to that character's wrong count, including wrongs already stored on this device. Words that are more than one character are not part of that count. These use the same anonymous id as the study log and go out on the next open, or when you tap Send study log now.",null)
B.avE=new A.pq("Reminders","Daily reminders are off until you turn them on. If you enable them, the app asks for notification permission and schedules local notifications on this device. Tapping a reminder opens the app. Scheduling uses your device time zone. Reminder settings are not uploaded.",null)
B.avF=new A.pq("What we do not collect","No account, email, or password. No contacts, camera, microphone, photos, or location GPS. An optional Chinese given name you choose stays on this device and is not an account or legal name. No advertising ID and no ads. No crash reporting. The study log does not include your name. A problem report is sent only when you tap Send.",null)
B.avG=new A.pq("Network","Fonts, speech, and course data are bundled in the app. A release build uses the internet to upload the study log, favorites, and character scores, and, when you tap Send, a problem report. The study log goes out on the first open of a new day, or sooner if you tap Send study log now. Favorites and character scores go out on the next open. Puzzle time in that log counts only while the puzzle is on screen and the app is open. The uploads are stored in Google Cloud Firestore for the developer of Hanzi Tree.",null)
B.avH=new A.pq("What stays on the device","Puzzle scores, lesson progress, starred puzzles, visit-day count, audio and reminder settings, chosen home and study nationalities (country codes only), an optional Chinese given-name preference, and similar preferences are stored locally (SharedPreferences and app-private files). You can erase learning progress with Reset all progress in Settings. Nationality choices and a saved Chinese name stay on this device until you change them.",null)
